				<a class="underline hover:text-orange-600" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/mockingjay-secure-recorder/id6758616261" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mockingjay</a>
				<a class="underline hover:text-orange-600" href="https://myvisualroutine.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MyVisualRoutine</a>
				<a class="underline hover:text-orange-600" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/padeliq-ai-match-analysis/id6796823937" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PadelIQ</a>
				<a class="underline hover:text-orange-600" href="https://stao.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Stao</a>
			</p>
			<p>
				<span class="font-semibold">For developers:</span>
				<a class="underline hover:text-orange-600" href="https://apidrift.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">APIDrift</a>
				<a class="underline hover:text-orange-600" href="https://kvile.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kvile</a>
				<a class="underline hover:text-orange-600" href="https://plask.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Plask</a>
				<a class="underline hover:text-orange-600" href="https://smia.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Smia</a>
			</p>
		</div>
		Copyright © {year.getFullYear()} | made with ♥️
	</footer>
</Section>
